rgbdns (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add opt-in offline authoritative DNSSEC signing with ECDSA P-256.
  * Serve RRSIG, DNSKEY, NSEC, wildcard, and delegation proofs from keyless
    authorities and transfer signed snapshots over standard AXFR.
  * Compose ACME overlays and ANAME materialization through atomic publication
    utilities, with cryptographic monitoring and last-known-good activation.
  * Support fail-closed mixed CDBs with explicit signed K and unsigned U zone
    dispositions while preserving unsigned ANAME and qualified data.

